# Performance & Initial Load (Non-Negotiable — Priority 1)

**Owner priority:** Fast first paint and low JS weight are as important as SEO. This site must feel instant on mid-tier mobile (4G).

## Targets (mobile, Lighthouse simulated throttling)

| Metric | Target | Stretch |
|--------|--------|---------|
| **LCP** | ≤ 2.0s | ≤ 1.8s |
| **INP** | ≤ 200ms | ≤ 150ms |
| **CLS** | ≤ 0.05 | 0 |
| **TTFB** (static) | ≤ 600ms | ≤ 400ms |
| **FCP** | ≤ 1.5s | ≤ 1.2s |
| **Lighthouse Performance** | ≥ 90 | ≥ 95 |
| **Lighthouse SEO** | ≥ 95 | 100 |

Run on **`/en`**, **`/fa`**, **`/en/projects`**, and one blog post before every release.

## Initial Load Strategy

### Static-first (default for all marketing pages)

```tsx
export const dynamic = 'force-static';
export const revalidate = false; // full static until explicit ISR need
```

- HTML for hero, nav, projects, and footer ships from CDN at build time
- Zero client fetch waterfalls on home and listing pages
- Contact form is the **only** section that may lazy-load client JS on `/contact`; on home, contact is a link — not an embedded form

### JavaScript budget

| Route | Max first-load JS (gzipped, approx.) |
|-------|--------------------------------------|
| Home | ≤ 80 KB |
| About / Skills / Experience | ≤ 70 KB |
| Projects list | ≤ 90 KB |
| Blog post | ≤ 100 KB |
| Contact | ≤ 120 KB (form allowed) |

If over budget: remove client components, defer icons, split locale fonts — do not raise the budget.

### `'use client'` allowlist

Only these may be Client Components:

- `ThemeToggle` (small; inline critical theme script prevents flash)
- `MobileNav` / sheet
- `LocaleSwitcher` (minimal)
- `ContactForm` (contact page only — `dynamic()` import)
- ShadCN primitives that require Radix behavior **inside** the above

Everything else — Hero, Projects, Skills, Experience, Blog layout, Footer — **Server Components**.

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD — contact form not on home
<Link href={`/${locale}/contact`}>{t('hero.cta.contact')}</Link>

// ❌ BAD — pulls form + validation JS into home bundle
<ContactForm />
```

## Images

```tsx
import Image from 'next/image';

<Image
  src={project.image}
  alt={project.imageAlt}
  width={800}
  height={450}
  sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 50vw, 33vw"
  loading="lazy"   // default; never priority below fold
/>
```

- `next/image` for all photos; WebP/AVIF via optimizer
- Project grid: **lazy** only; no `priority` on cards
- Hero: **no image** preferred — if used, one `priority` image, explicit dimensions, ≤ 100 KB source
- Placeholder: `blurDataURL` or solid `aspect-ratio` — never empty box CLS

## Fonts (critical path)

```tsx
import { Inter, Vazirmatn } from 'next/font/google';

const inter = Inter({
  subsets: ['latin'],
  display: 'swap',
  variable: '--font-sans-en',
  preload: true,
});
```

- Load **one** font family per locale layout — EN layout loads Inter only; FA layout loads Vazirmatn only
- No `@import` from Google Fonts in CSS
- `font-display: swap` always; preload only the active locale's primary weight (400 + 600 max)

## CSS

- Tailwind purge enabled; no unused ShadCN components installed upfront — add on demand
- Critical above-fold styles inline via Tailwind — no render-blocking extra CSS files
- Animations: CSS only; `prefers-reduced-motion` respected

## Data & Rendering

- Projects, experience, skills: static import at build — **no** `useEffect` fetch
- Blog MDX: compile at build; syntax highlighter loaded per-post, not globally if avoidable
- No React Query, SWR, or Redux on marketing pages

## Third Party (defer or skip)

- **No** analytics in v1 unless deferred until after `load` or first interaction
- **No** LinkedIn embed widgets — static link + icon
- **No** chat widgets, heatmaps, or A/B scripts on initial load
- Nest contact API called only from contact page submit — not prefetched

## Theme (avoid flash + extra work)

```tsx
// inline in <head> — before paint, ~50 bytes
<script dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: `...theme from localStorage...` }} />
```

- `suppressHydrationWarning` on `<html>`
- Default theme: `light` (fewer paint surprises); dark via class toggle

## Bundle hygiene

```tsx
import { ArrowUpRight } from 'lucide-react'; // ✅ single icon

const ContactForm = dynamic(() => import('@/components/sections/ContactForm'), {
  ssr: false,
  loading: () => <ContactFormSkeleton />,
});
```

- Analyze with `@next/bundle-analyzer` before release
- Tree-shake lucide; no barrel imports from heavy libs
- No Framer Motion, GSAP, or Lottie on marketing pages

## Measurement workflow

1. `npm run build && npm run start` — test production, not dev
2. Lighthouse mobile on 4 routes × 2 locales
3. [PageSpeed Insights](https://pagespeed.web.dev/) on production URL after deploy
4. If any gate fails — fix before adding features

## Ship Gates (Performance)

- [ ] Lighthouse Performance ≥ 90 mobile (EN + FA home)
- [ ] LCP element is text or pre-optimized image — not late-loading carousel
- [ ] View Page Source: hero text visible in HTML
- [ ] No layout shift on font or theme load
- [ ] Project images lazy; hero has no heavy media by default
